-- Defaults declared in an IMPORTED module are taken at a named site and at a
-- construction here (TYPICALLY-ONE-BEHAVIOUR-SPEC.md W4 and W5 across an
-- IMPORT). The declaring half is ok/typically-import-def.l4.

IMPORT `typically-import-def`

#ASSERT (`imported scaled` WITH base IS 10) EQUALS 30
#ASSERT (`imported scaled` WITH base IS 10, rate IS 2) EQUALS 20
#ASSERT (`imported scaled` WITH base IS 10, colour IS Red) EQUALS 0

GIVETH A Paint
`some paint` MEANS Paint WITH coats IS 2

#ASSERT (`some paint`'s colour) EQUALS Red
#ASSERT (`some paint`'s coats) EQUALS 2
#EVAL `some paint`
